%!PS
% SPDX-FileCopyrightText: 2026 EfterScript contributors
% SPDX-License-Identifier: MIT
% Scenario: a pattern painting text. A resident font is shown with a
% pattern as the current colour: the run is a text object painted in
% the pattern, and the page's resources hold the font and the pattern.
/P << /PatternType 1 /PaintType 1 /TilingType 1 /BBox [0 0 8 8]
  /XStep 8 /YStep 8 /PaintProc { pop 0 0 4 4 rectfill } >> matrix makepattern def
/Helvetica-Bold findfont 96 scalefont setfont
P setpattern
60 300 moveto (Tiles) show
showpage
